ntroller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":1866270,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help protect Melora from Runi and his many creations in this unique and charming Soulslike Metroidvania FPS Adventure, where you'll never know what could be around the next corner. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1853760/extras/banner.png?t=1743781429\" />Explore an atmospheric and colorful world with a cast of characters, who mostly have good intentions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1853760/extras/swampbanner.png?t=1743781429\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1853760/extras/banner2.png?t=1743781429\" />Fight over 30 unique bosses that will test your limits and reward you heartily. All with their own mechanics and personalities to enjoy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1853760/extras/snakebanner.png?t=1743781429\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1853760/extras/banner3.png?t=1743781429\" />Keep an eye out for bugs. Catch them with your tongue and equip them to gain a variety of bonuses... you are a Frog after all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1853760/extras/bugbanner.png?t=1743781429\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1853760/extras/banner4.png?t=1743781429\" />Find weapons and choose upgrade paths to suit them to a variety of playstyles, and use spells to heal and zap, burn, explode... any enemy in your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1853760/extras/gunbanner.png?t=1743781429\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy a weird and winding world, finding upgrades and abilities, to push further and reset the balance after Runi messed it all up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">POST LAUNCH UPDATES\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bonus Boss's Update\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight 3 New Bosses: Balsam, Borp, and Mud!</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Boss Soup Update</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive in to trenches soup and fight through 4 rounds of boss rush mode!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each of the four soups contains it's own new boss fight at the end I wonder who they could be!\u00a0</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Item Randomizer</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hop onto the randomizer branch and connect to archipelago to play Frogmonster with items randomized.</p></li></ul></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Music Update </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Brad new Soundtrack including over 50 tracks </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Including tracks for every boss fight!</p></li></ul></li></ul>","developers":["Ben Jungwirth"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1853760/67d8c8ea7b9853b95025bf31f99333d346e1f5b7/header_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1743781429","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"b